{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f9e22c962e50b0762979c0a829a470e50764140a96e81f9f45b4902506d61419","ja":"エレガントなお仕事","zh":"优雅的工作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2063c3f327c368040c79d008731cc5c68277106ecd6852cf878bb1ee718f483f","ja":"今日のお仕事は雑誌の撮影。\n『エレガントな和の休日』という特集のモデルで……","zh":"今天的工作是杂志拍摄。\n担任名为《高雅和风假日》特辑的模特……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2bcc7e79e6155ca1f788297e3d0b3b1736a882f2869fdae24add6c8d2ef85be2","ja":"「優雅でお嬢様なおふたりは、今回の企画のイメージに\nぴったりです！　きっと話題になりますよ！」","zh":"“优雅的大小姐二人组，非常契合这次企划的\n形象！肯定会成为热门话题的！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fb5a9d6c5bcbdf1029b3ab09adf39da6def7b12388e9c5027045c47be3ed5fbf","ja":"「オファーを請けていただいて、本当にありがとう\nございました！　今日はよろしくお願いします！！」","zh":"“非常感谢各位接下这次的工作邀约！\n今天就拜托大家了！！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4a7baa60b005f5d3668c83c5e1d047c5ded6c2ec41017f8419ca2f0d510c2ccf","ja":"そ、そんなに期待していただけてるなんて……。\n自信はないですけど、頑張ります。","zh":"没、没想到大家这么期待我……\n虽然没有什么自信，但我会努力的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"273db9cde2039441035ed6652d1dce775df9dc8bc089bcb37d31361cf233c652","ja":"精一杯、務めさせていただきます。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いいたします。","zh":"我会全力以赴的。\n我这边才是，请多关照。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"581a17393f7f9d38429a6b4093c3a2293beda0b398410e29f598d1c628b31824","ja":"（私にうまくできるかしら……。\nき、期待が大きすぎてプレッシャーが……）","zh":"（我真的能做好吗……。\n大、大家的期待太高了，好有压力……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"205a9cabb01baed6db0ef096d753c489c5738a07870312c30df8bad09905797a","ja":"（紬ちゃんは所作が綺麗だから、選ばれたのも\n納得だけど……とにかくエレガントにしないと！）","zh":"（小紬的一举一动都很优美，被选上也是\n情理之中……总之我必须要表现得优雅才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5a0cf748e16636f59d585c16b7a276b0e7e151f398d1b51fda0a1203e2e9139f","ja":"いろいろな和の名店や名所を巡ることが\nできるのですね。とても楽しみです。","zh":"能够游览各式各样的和风名店和名胜呢。\n我非常期待。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9be2a1edc5a84a74c5a8606f269da4aa06d0b92e689c9da8398be0821fd7ed28","ja":"そ、そうね、私も楽しみだわ！","zh":"是、是啊，我也很期待呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2da2853ceb9f5a83d3959d50694c7d60a74d0591c1deb2588853bb5aded937bb","ja":"「それでは、最初は和菓子を楽しむ\nシチュエーションから……」","zh":"“那么，首先从享用日式点心的\n场景开始……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"fc2227da52be67148dbc42a07448380ffb3bd5e91f2ced707fd8ed8b0985c2a6","ja":"ごちそうさまでした。\nお茶も甘味も、とても美味しかったですね。","zh":"承蒙款待。\n茶水和甜点都非常美味呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"8bff371f43cd5e439ab771f40244d8710785b9c113131f0925828b6b7dccf3a3","ja":"あの、桜守さん、どうかしましたか？","zh":"那个，樱守小姐，请问怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"6840b92171e3cbaeb40e21a1fdf0d4a20e848b1a5f1f236eec75f3f4e640f493","ja":"えっ……！　あ、ごめんなさい。\nそうね、とっても美味しかったわね。","zh":"哎……！啊，抱歉。\n是啊，味道真的很棒呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9c5ca2f6e0ef01223145325147197bc88728b15b9fa43dcfb8a761c43de36e7c","ja":"（本当は緊張で、\n味は良く分からなかったんだけど……）","zh":"（其实当时太紧张了，\n根本没怎么尝出味道来就是了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"74ce596ed00257174713da76718a7f07cefa3e3159c3366c5a8d753d3d56786a","ja":"（こ、こんな調子じゃダメだわ！　スタッフさんの\n期待に応えられるように頑張らないと！）","zh":"（这、这样下去可不行！我得努力\n回应工作人员的期待才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
